Setup Java
Setup Node.js
Upload artifacts
Deploy applications

Marketplace:

GitHub Marketplace

Example:

- uses: actions/setup-node@v4
10. Language-Specific Actions
Java
- uses: actions/setup-java@v4
  with:
    java-version: '21'
Node.js
- uses: actions/setup-node@v4
  with:
    node-version: '20'
Python
- uses: actions/setup-python@v5
  with:
    python-version: '3.11'
PHP
- uses: shivammathur/setup-php@v2
  with:
    php-version: '8.3'

Useful for Laravel projects.
